# Hostinger MySQL connection string
# Format: mysql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:PORT/DBNAME
#
# hPanel → Databases → MySQL Databases → veritabanı oluştur + user
# Host: Hostinger Node.js Apps build container'ından localhost erişilmez,
#       Hostinger MySQL için "MySQL Remote Access" hostname'i kullan (örn.
#       hPanel → MySQL → Remote MySQL → "Internal database hostname").
# Örnek:
#   mysql://u302466594_brytakip:STRONGPASS@srv1234.hstgr.io:3306/u302466594_brytakip
DATABASE_URL="mysql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:3306/DBNAME"

# Admin token — admin endpoint'lerine erişim için (uzun random string)
# Terminal: `openssl rand -hex 32`
ADMIN_TOKEN="paste-a-long-random-hex-string-here"

# Production mode (Hostinger otomatik set'ler)
NODE_ENV="production"
